  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.639814,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Let us talk about—well, anything you will.",
      "output_sha256": "abb73fcd9e51710096b539bac5f23b91d8a10a70d4d6079fd5ee6d91f41bcc5d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "abb73fcd9e51710096b539bac5f23b91d8a10a70d4d6079fd5ee6d91f41bcc5d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Goldfish, for instance.",
      "output_sha256": "8ed294451629d2cf5f12cd74c383421f13d39b4eb5deb1f159fd9aced8660a8f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "8ed294451629d2cf5f12cd74c383421f13d39b4eb5deb1f159fd9aced8660a8f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Goldfish are a symbol of old-world tranquillity or mid-Victorian futility according to their position in the home.",
      "output_sha256": "b4d16b98ef56c788965fb322548393a89adfb7f5c872189ca7104dfd35bde7b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "b4d16b98ef56c788965fb322548393a89adfb7f5c872189ca7104dfd35bde7b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Outside the home, in that wild state from which civilization has dragged them, they may have stood for dare-devil courage or constancy or devotion; I cannot tell.",
      "output_sha256": "174e7d86ab3b79938f2eaf4b811c9ae323c5f8de26a07622794cbe37a24854ff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "174e7d86ab3b79938f2eaf4b811c9ae323c5f8de26a07622794cbe37a24854ff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I can only describe how I see them now, commonly in the garden or within the confines of a drawing-room.",
      "output_sha256": "74d6bf8f2dc6c2e3e934eae94299c8bff09cca4ae9510cbb473f77964802384d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.535714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2644eb22ad9c9b12f46c321de26021dcd8c06911b18f11243fdd8ac39472f0d4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "74d6bf8f2dc6c2e3e934eae94299c8bff09cca4ae9510cbb473f77964802384d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In their lily-leaved pool, sunk deep in the old flagged terrace, upon whose borders the blackbird whistles his early-morning song, they remind me of sundials and lavender and old delightful things.",
      "output_sha256": "4ebc4b4e2b27fc7f3f6fc8c4c018ec3293313158da5d5a6ea5f4b12fe86562db",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "4ebc4b4e2b27fc7f3f6fc8c4c018ec3293313158da5d5a6ea5f4b12fe86562db",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Conversely, in their inexpensive glass bowl perched on a three-legged table, beneath the silent watch of a cloth-covered canary, they conjure images of antimacassars, horsehair sofas, and an overall sense of gloom.",
      "output_sha256": "f1cb52c887721ba7efc2d2c86a4da8be2c88dd334403c3ad1fcb4740582be61f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.451359,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e483867a1176588d91f338e7c63eda7138b1d836d64b669a1a8c48c6f0cdefbc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f1cb52c887721ba7efc2d2c86a4da8be2c88dd334403c3ad1fcb4740582be61f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It seems rather unfair that the goldfish has so little say in their circumstances.",
      "output_sha256": "da07010302805f8de16444745d09f915d645f6fcdb3ff7000486b882ae60f066",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.503908,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9651420a447a4c2877ba46113590729ed5bb3da5c3162ba25b754a9ccd694554"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "da07010302805f8de16444745d09f915d645f6fcdb3ff7000486b882ae60f066",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "They appear charming in the pond, yet I suspect it was not a quest for beauty that led them there.",
      "output_sha256": "51533e30d3d4670983fd2be78c43d3c44e7b8e24a0639e852b04b4bb9da3aadf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.447488,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e82480772e0557c20e840d3ea1ba82ba637ab14eb1bcc257f88781e88fadd73a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "51533e30d3d4670983fd2be78c43d3c44e7b8e24a0639e852b04b4bb9da3aadf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Rather the need for some thing to throw things to.",
      "output_sha256": "6a96ae0fcc7edf936b5c5dc515013edc9bc6ae0ec176426a055dd65cbe130395",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "6a96ae0fcc7edf936b5c5dc515013edc9bc6ae0ec176426a055dd65cbe130395",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "No one of the initiate can sit in front of Nature's most wonderful effect, the sea, without wishing to throw stones into it, the physical pleasure of the effort and the aesthetic pleasure of the splash combining to produce perfect contentment.",
      "output_sha256": "9027dac87e7a5db26c4cc24e2aa1480aebffd426663a21a110f7ead077be20c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "9027dac87e7a5db26c4cc24e2aa1480aebffd426663a21a110f7ead077be20c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "So by the margin of the pool the same desires stir within one, and because ants' eggs do not splash, and look untidy on the surface of the water, there must be a gleam of gold and silver to put the crown upon one's pleasure.",
      "output_sha256": "2fba452605d296fcac6b6e61f08061c65a5c5dce464b915eb2d5ec63489823ba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "2fba452605d296fcac6b6e61f08061c65a5c5dce464b915eb2d5ec63489823ba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Perhaps when you have been feeding the goldfish you have not thought of it like that.",
      "output_sha256": "8498ad7ae55d26b7897a5f280c252c667a01f3d6daa1795849196b4f995c2bea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "8498ad7ae55d26b7897a5f280c252c667a01f3d6daa1795849196b4f995c2bea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But at least you must have wondered why, of all diets, they should prefer ants' eggs.",
      "output_sha256": "46ce4a2de18621e0e99cff2d6108119f12f7e0a9783031f7e65f795d21957f37",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "46ce4a2de18621e0e99cff2d6108119f12f7e0a9783031f7e65f795d21957f37",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Ants’ eggs are not the kind of food one would instinctively choose; they must surely be an acquired taste.",
      "output_sha256": "500671c9727c4d92114e16f2ac98af5a99da93c59ae658d36660ab8c0eadb745",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.438947,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "906b892ccadccf45192518bee0836b63157a2c884e729a7eb3d1c7a3dc73b746"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "500671c9727c4d92114e16f2ac98af5a99da93c59ae658d36660ab8c0eadb745",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This raises the question of how goldfish came to develop such a preference.",
      "output_sha256": "22ddfae894ff3e824b7c35895d7112263df39809069bc866a0414a032a4f5506",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.319305,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8122fb0d4b3d9ff8a015dc51ca7ca3346d7e34955fb21feb191729b12e6da8b8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "22ddfae894ff3e824b7c35895d7112263df39809069bc866a0414a032a4f5506",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I suppose (but I am lamentably ignorant on these as on all other matters) that there was a time when goldfish lived a wild free life of their own.",
      "output_sha256": "156a10fac30980e83907e3df86afd5460c330c769b9dbcb0b043434d83b8924f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "156a10fac30980e83907e3df86afd5460c330c769b9dbcb0b043434d83b8924f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "They swam in the ocean or rivers, battling for survival while Nature, as is her way, provided them with suitable nourishment.",
      "output_sha256": "6755999e871f840240724ade9c56ad1a69dad1f588dae91935729ac63f6144ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.331692,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "11fe98211668f92433f7a65bd5eeff27fb146e47215d3a30bb30f9bb3bf3f91a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6755999e871f840240724ade9c56ad1a69dad1f588dae91935729ac63f6144ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Now I have often come across ants' nests in my travels, but never when swimming.",
      "output_sha256": "d2b678dcce56cb68b61fbcf456b881ae277674dad4364d8a44e5c5f9c80b2f9a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "d2b678dcce56cb68b61fbcf456b881ae277674dad4364d8a44e5c5f9c80b2f9a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In seas and rivers, pools and lakes, I have wandered, but Nature has never put ants' eggs in my way.",
      "output_sha256": "3c4702061b449b216acbf64ce9caa826e86f45461eda6a8b8375c63b6d3c496e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "3c4702061b449b216acbf64ce9caa826e86f45461eda6a8b8375c63b6d3c496e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "No doubt—it would be only right- -the goldfish has a keener eye than I have for these things, but if they had been there, should I have missed them so completely?",
      "output_sha256": "e39807683d801e2af11fceadc7d1563c1b7c401ef7a2f8a58e5e7b98ac7ed22e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "e39807683d801e2af11fceadc7d1563c1b7c401ef7a2f8a58e5e7b98ac7ed22e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I think not, for if they had been there, they must have been there in great quantities.",
      "output_sha256": "55345694530b8c881e120ab8e94947883c1ddbfce8009015ba70fbff0bc4fc62",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "55345694530b8c881e120ab8e94947883c1ddbfce8009015ba70fbff0bc4fc62",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I can imagine a goldfish slowly acquiring the taste for them through the centuries, but only if other food were denied to him, only if, wherever he went, ants' eggs, ants' eggs, ants' eggs drifted down the stream to him.",
      "output_sha256": "49ba75c2d30237c605f4a785a796486ed4720887859fb1ffb07c803b134ed23a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "49ba75c2d30237c605f4a785a796486ed4720887859fb1ffb07c803b134ed23a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Yet, since it would seem that he has acquired the taste, it can only be that the taste has come to him with captivity—has been forced upon him, I should have said.",
      "output_sha256": "8ba353d793ab34084a07d6dc897f3385beb846bf8ff06e4fa18d1328b2f8bdfe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "8ba353d793ab34084a07d6dc897f3385beb846bf8ff06e4fa18d1328b2f8bdfe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The old wild goldfish (this is my theory) was a more terrible beast than we think.",
      "output_sha256": "4eab7ca3d7621b13061b7a65d70b79216ef8316ab51e7bca3fdaa3640ce755f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "4eab7ca3d7621b13061b7a65d70b79216ef8316ab51e7bca3fdaa3640ce755f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "If given the right diet, he would likely have resisted confinement to a terrace pool.",
      "output_sha256": "6719f012e126c7f8be4d0be4572b69b8823a53b778a8751b4c1a63144a20d6dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.430935,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "482a56743f4ae698ee0d8f79f12e0617749a026b1568b6fc120f75e7af58c06c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6719f012e126c7f8be4d0be4572b69b8823a53b778a8751b4c1a63144a20d6dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He would have been unsuited to domestic life; he would have dragged in the shrieking child as she leant to feed him.",
      "output_sha256": "5d7276b2e1bca1e9001328f4ea3c1fce6b558f49a9cd5d12ad6f4bb6b9259600",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "5d7276b2e1bca1e9001328f4ea3c1fce6b558f49a9cd5d12ad6f4bb6b9259600",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "As the result of many experiments ants' eggs were given him to keep him thin (you can see for yourself what a bloodless diet it is), ants' eggs were given him to quell his spirit; and just as a man, if he has sufficient colds, can get up a passion even for ammoniated quinine, so the goldfish has grown in captivity to welcome the once-hated omelette.",
      "output_sha256": "ed63a831066c06c9cefddcd5a4e13a113def4931db73b4b5d204519294f41970",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "ed63a831066c06c9cefddcd5a4e13a113def4931db73b4b5d204519294f41970",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Now, let’s examine the situation of the goldfish residing within the household.",
      "output_sha256": "9357e5b0f03949a0361047be8c1fb365d04fa0919622eb3b9e5338b152636617",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.471154,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "80aea75f233231df9d6c0efc115b02ce4893886527c03b6a8776ed3cac497b87"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9357e5b0f03949a0361047be8c1fb365d04fa0919622eb3b9e5338b152636617",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "While his diet remains unchanged, his environment is vastly different.",
      "output_sha256": "296d9ad7677bfe64f91644c295e3fb850c59fff14ca84f4d786b9797e131078f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.44,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c9d9e65dc1a25e3f5a31e215b4947e30998a0b3eb02f6cdd2562e64b91712afa"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "296d9ad7677bfe64f91644c295e3fb850c59fff14ca84f4d786b9797e131078f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If his bowl is placed on a table in the middle of the floor, he has but to flash his tail once and he has been all round the drawing-room.",
      "output_sha256": "00c4e3093725f4c987d1ddb85d8d05a8ef34cca5d1bace55c5b84020b9993e72",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "00c4e3093725f4c987d1ddb85d8d05a8ef34cca5d1bace55c5b84020b9993e72",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The drawing-room may not seem much to you, but to him this impressionist picture through the curved glass must be amazing.",
      "output_sha256": "54f78309309703bc6bc7aa98ac2ef13f555d80ce59ad13715138747b7213cb66",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "54f78309309703bc6bc7aa98ac2ef13f555d80ce59ad13715138747b7213cb66",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Let not the outdoor goldfish boast of his freedom.",
      "output_sha256": "c038727d4ec33b896e806efca90b983b0ed74dfbfaa33facee3e8242c9e9225a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "c038727d4ec33b896e806efca90b983b0ed74dfbfaa33facee3e8242c9e9225a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "What does he, in his little world of water-lily roots, know of the vista upon vista which opens to his more happy brother as he passes jauntily from china dog to ottoman and from ottoman to Henry's father?",
      "output_sha256": "08f1ee88a0b4396c84674684b3cb59275df594d58d08ba93fbbfe8fba10557de",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "08f1ee88a0b4396c84674684b3cb59275df594d58d08ba93fbbfe8fba10557de",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Ah, here is life!",
      "output_sha256": "69958d1b6ee768a7a6986033f73970203617c944c6660d86231da2ad5ae3694a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "69958d1b6ee768a7a6986033f73970203617c944c6660d86231da2ad5ae3694a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It may be that in the course of years he will get used to it, even bored by it; indeed, for that reason I always advocate giving him a glance at the dining-room or the bedrooms on Wednesdays and Saturdays; but his first day in the bowl must be the opening of an undreamt of heaven to him.",
      "output_sha256": "0b856f8bb5f9c0397e8e161f731bfdb86408e72f279a55160d5523e32b824b89",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "0b856f8bb5f9c0397e8e161f731bfdb86408e72f279a55160d5523e32b824b89",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Again, what an adventurous life is his.",
      "output_sha256": "ae5484feb0620d2257a96dcd90f3ee3ac4b6cfdaa7ec047722479e4cae0b5b62",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "ae5484feb0620d2257a96dcd90f3ee3ac4b6cfdaa7ec047722479e4cae0b5b62",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "At any moment, a cat might leap up and snatch him away, a child might accidentally topple him, or adults might neglect to feed him or refresh his water.",
      "output_sha256": "2668d0de7ff220c10ef93dc5b3d48cc202a22701a8df34f3b6b9174b47d52298",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.639814,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "15767abf5938cb344557ec76efb2dfd7179eed69078db3042a8cd23651742965"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2668d0de7ff220c10ef93dc5b3d48cc202a22701a8df34f3b6b9174b47d52298",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The temptation to take him up and massage him must be irresistible to outsiders.",
      "output_sha256": "af54b6a36111e21a8672c06350c370306e90735d528952216698876fe796830a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "af54b6a36111e21a8672c06350c370306e90735d528952216698876fe796830a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "All these dangers the goldfish in the pond avoids; he lives a sheltered and unexciting life, and when he wants to die he dies unnoticed, unregretted, but for his brother the tears and the solemn funeral.",
      "output_sha256": "a4f1b0a073c634ed7d4d63cf56b73b1d64c449dcbcdc2bb528085be56307db34",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "a4f1b0a073c634ed7d4d63cf56b73b1d64c449dcbcdc2bb528085be56307db34",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Upon reflection, I realize I was mistaken in labeling the indoor goldfish as an emblem of mid-Victorian futility.",
      "output_sha256": "91a2781e6cfe9e7e92bdcccdebe105346e640dca666603e48d95c2209e2cc787",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.433127,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4e4324684cfce19acc8a7ecb79fc925b5c6b384ced436ec8b0fb106cbce6edd5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "91a2781e6cfe9e7e92bdcccdebe105346e640dca666603e48d95c2209e2cc787",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "An article of this sort is no good if it does not teach the writer something as well as his readers.",
      "output_sha256": "a34db831ec6082cd9860201ad2342c893a03c2b65d59490aa7efa728c4c54a67",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "a34db831ec6082cd9860201ad2342c893a03c2b65d59490aa7efa728c4c54a67",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I now understand that he represents enterprise and resilience, restlessness and the essence of Post-Impressionism.",
      "output_sha256": "c6df5928d93ee267c7170f2f0c2510a1f00dd3cf33b12e2f3403e2c845cf8e07",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.56,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e4d6127067877e0a7cfeac6648f9e38e4569eddc43a64b22768fd8aa18ff110a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c6df5928d93ee267c7170f2f0c2510a1f00dd3cf33b12e2f3403e2c845cf8e07",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He is not a relic of the mid-Victorian era, but rather a creature of the Fifth Georgian period.",
      "output_sha256": "d03e704ec9d0291843f9faac27ff12fa27fa3bb90b2bcf42391f45d640e1ee3e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.459081,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2704671991c02d27753c4e315f4c2cad34ac151526891f4008070aa58038c16c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d03e704ec9d0291843f9faac27ff12fa27fa3bb90b2bcf42391f45d640e1ee3e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "That encapsulates all I wish to convey regarding goldfish.",
      "output_sha256": "f50d39022add741b8cf0826b01795f21ebc0d50f69af9e56083e720fe6a2c9b3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.466667,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c9edd11189784215e452301fc879b8c386f2ac7e225ee2dba9792f4a6fbc4155"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f50d39022add741b8cf0826b01795f21ebc0d50f69af9e56083e720fe6a2c9b3",
